title: The Italian Comrades
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and c_italy_timer <= 0 and time >= 6
on-arrival: c_italy_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: international

= The Italian Comrades

[? if year <= 1920 : Italy is in its two red years. Serrati's Socialist Party has joined the International, the peasants are taking the land, and in Turin Antonio Gramsci's Ordine Nuovo group builds factory councils. ?][? if year = 1921 or (year = 1922 and month < 10) : At Livorno, the Comintern demanded that the Italian Socialists expel their reformists. Serrati refused, and the communists walked out to found a small party of their own. Since then Mussolini's blackshirts have burned down the workers' houses one province at a time. ?][? if (year = 1922 and month >= 10) or year >= 1923 : Mussolini has marched on Rome, and the King has made him prime minister. The Italian left, split three ways, could not stop him. ?]

- @councils: Hold up Turin as the model for Germany.
- @unity: Defend the unity of the Italian left.
- @clean_break: Back Moscow's demand for a clean break.
- @antifascist: Send money to the Italians fighting the blackshirts.
- @easy_discard

@councils
subtitle: The shop stewards of Berlin and Halle read Gramsci closely.
view-if: year <= 1920
on-arrival: {!
RG.district('berlin', {militancy: 4});
RG.district('halle', {militancy: 4});
Q.lean_ultraleft += 1;
!}

@unity
subtitle: A split now hands Italy to the reaction, we say. Zinoviev will not like it.
view-if: year >= 1921 and year <= 1922
on-arrival: {!
Q.independence += 5;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -6);
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
!}

A small sect cut off from the masses is no gain, the Zentrale writes. The Executive is not amused.

@clean_break
subtitle: [? if lock_moscow_orders = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] No room in the International for reformists. Zinoviev is pleased.
view-if: year >= 1921 and year <= 1922
choose-if: lock_moscow_orders < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids taking orders from Moscow.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_moscow_orders == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 8);
Q.independence -= 4;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

@antifascist
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The exiles who come north bring stories that the young workers listen to.
view-if: year >= 1921
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; world_revolution += 3; red_guards_loyalty += 5

The money goes over the Alps to the families of the dead and to the comrades hiding in Milan and Turin.
